  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5038c0b5-f926-42b5-9c89-5c65ad4e1caf"],
 " is a member of the matching segment head; an arbitrary longer walk between \
the same endpoints is not."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"ef0936fe-c70f-4ba3-8c60-4378a7158fd8"],

